WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.200
Your son thought it was just drunken rambling

00:03.280 --> 00:04.920
This man, as Chancellor of the Imperial Academy

00:05.000 --> 00:06.280
Has considerable reputation

00:06.360 --> 00:07.640
Your son feared that arresting him

00:07.720 --> 00:08.200
Would affect Father's

00:08.280 --> 00:09.840
Standing among scholars

00:11.080 --> 00:12.960
The hearts of scholars

00:13.080 --> 00:15.000
The hearts of all people

00:15.960 --> 00:18.627
Is this all you can say to me?

